<title>USA: K&amp;G Men's Q3 same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>K&amp;G Men's Q3 same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>K&amp;G Men's Center Inc on Wednesday said same-store sales increased by 11.1 percent for the three months ended October 27, 1996, against a rise of 8.1 percent for the year-ago period.</p>
<p>For the nine months ended October 27, 1996, same-store sales increased 11.1 percent while sales for the year-ago period were up 12.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
